nts? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">Abstract</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section\">\n<a href=\"#S1\" title=\"In Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">1 </span>Introduction</span></a>\n<ol class=\"ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section\">\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#S1.SS0.SSS0.Px1\" title=\"In 1 Introduction ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">Contribution 1: we build a perturbation suite for real human input errors.</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#S1.SS0.SSS0.Px2\" title=\"In 1 Introduction ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">Contribution 2: we measure how much input perturbation costs LLM task accuracy, per channel.</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#S1.SS0.SSS0.Px3\" title=\"In 1 Introduction ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">Contribution 3: we explain where the damage from input perturbation comes from.</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#S1.SS0.SSS0.Px4\" title=\"In 1 Introduction ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">Contribution 4: we show what does and does not mitigate the harm from input perturbation.</span></a></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section\">\n<a href=\"#S2\" title=\"In Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">2 </span>Related Work</span></a>\n<ol class=\"ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section\">\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#S2.SS0.SSS0.Px1\" title=\"In 2 Related Work ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">LLM input perturbation robustness.</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#S2.SS0.SSS0.Px2\" title=\"In 2 Related Work ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">Voice and transcription robustness.</span></a></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section\">\n<a href=\"#S3\" title=\"In Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">3 </span>HIVE</span></a>\n<ol class=\"ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section\">\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#S3.SS0.SSS0.Px1\" title=\"In 3 HIVE ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">The HIVE engine.</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection\"><a href=\"#S3.SS1\" title=\"In 3 HIVE ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">3.1 </span>Voice transcription perturbations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection\"><a href=\"#S3.SS2\" title=\"In 3 HIVE ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">3.2 </span>QWERTY keyboard perturbations</span></a></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section\">\n<a href=\"#S4\" title=\"In Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">4 </span>Experiments</span></a>\n<ol class=\"ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section\">\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#S4.SS0.SSS0.Px1\" title=\"In 4 Experiments ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">Models, benchmarks, seeds.</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#S4.SS0.SSS0.Px2\" title=\"In 4 Experiments ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">Test-set contamination controls.</span></a></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section\"><a href=\"#S5\" title=\"In Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">5 </span>Main Results</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section\">\n<a href=\"#S6\" title=\"In Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">6 </span>Findings</span></a>\n<ol class=\"ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section\">\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px1\" title=\"In 6 Findings ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">Fillers are sufficient but not necessary for the spoken penalty.</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px2\" title=\"In 6 Findings ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">QWERTY-shaped errors cost less than arbitrary ones.</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px3\" title=\"In 6 Findings ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">Models absorb a surprising amount of typing error, then break suddenly.</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px4\" title=\"In 6 Findings ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">Which modality you use only matters when the model has to build the answer.</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px5\" title=\"In 6 Findings ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">Destroying the original tokens is what hurts. Adding new ones on top is close\nto free.</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px6\" title=\"In 6 Findings ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">Token survival is the dominant predictor, and it holds at the character level\ntoo.</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px7\" title=\"In 6 Findings ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">The same harm pattern holds on a decontaminated rebuild of GSM8K.</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px8\" title=\"In 6 Findings ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">Adapting to the errors costs base performance.</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px9\" title=\"In 6 Findings ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">Reasoning repairs a garbled question, not a simplified one.</span></a></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section\"><a href=\"#S7\" title=\"In Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">7 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#Sx1.SS0.SSS0.Px1\" title=\"In Limitations ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">Scope.</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#Sx1.SS0.SSS0.Px2\" title=\"In Limitations ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">One keyboard layout.</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#Sx1.SS0.SSS0.Px3\" title=\"In Limitations ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">Synthetic speech, not audio.</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography\"><a href=\"#bib\" title=\"In Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">References</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix\">\n<a href=\"#A1\" title=\"In Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">A </span>Methodology, experiments and discussion</span></a>\n<ol class=\"ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix\">\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection\"><a href=\"#A1.SS1\" title=\"In Appendix A Methodology, experiments and discussion ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">A.1 </span>Methodology</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection\">\n<a href=\"#A1.SS2\" title=\"In Appendix A Methodology, experiments and discussion ‣ Should We Type or Talk to LLM Agents? A Comprehensive Study of Voice and Keyboard Input Perturbations\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">A.2 </span>Operator specification</span></a>\n<ol class=\"ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection\">\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph\"><a href=\"#A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1\" title=\"In A.2 Operator specification ‣ Appendix A Methodology, experi